 * Start the backend WebSocket server *
1. Download or clone the backend repository
2. Open a terminal in the backend folder.
3. Run the Go server (go run main.go)
4. The WebSocket server will start on: (ws://localhost:8080/ws)

* Start the chat client *
1. Open a new terminal and go to the client folder (cd client)
2. Install dependencies (npm install)
3. Run the client (node client.js)
4. You should now see:
- Connected to Kabaw WebSocket
- Joined channel message
- Real-time chat messages from the server
5. Type a message and press Enter to send it.
